       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Order as written:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Maximum daily dose:** The usual prescription maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day. That is double the limit for this order.\n- **Maximum single dose:** The usual single-dose maximum is 800 mg. This order's single dose is double that.\n- **Risks at this dose:** It raises the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. This applies even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily (3,200 mg/day).** This is the maximum prescription dose.\n- **600 mg by mouth, 4 times daily (2,400 mg/day).**\n- **400 mg by mouth, 4 times daily (1,600 mg/day).** Possibly 1,600 mg total per day was intended.\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that explicitly and give the clinical rationale. I can add that to the order note. Otherwise, tell me the corrected dose and I'll enter it."
